  "prefLabel": "Ins 4105.07 Interim Filing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4105.07 Interim Filing. Small employer stop loss carriers may make an interim filing between its required annual filings, to propose adjustments to only certain factors.\n\nSource. #9690, eff 4-9-10; ss by #9938, eff 6-10-11; ss by #12799, eff 6-10-19",
